{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53398","headline":"秋怀 · 段弘古","name":"秋怀","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"野濶平收潦水香，园林恰似郑公乡。\n懒云未许寒风卷，落叶从他零露伤。\n夜静猿声添客泪，朝闻雁字引诗狂。\n生涯不共秋光老，浊酒丹经一钓航。\n（见同治十三年刊《直隶澧州志》卷二五）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"段弘古","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_53398.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_53398","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}